00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:17.900
Oh, and you don't have to worry about getting in on time.

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:19.900
The office is over there.

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:21.900
I have to get back to class.

00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:23.900
Thank you.

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:24.900
Bye.

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:25.900
Goodbye.

00:21:25.900 --> 00:21:27.900
Goodbye.

