You really want to know?

00:23:01.900 --> 00:23:04.900
Yes, I really want to know.

00:23:04.900 --> 00:23:07.900
It wasn't any big thing.

00:23:07.900 --> 00:23:10.900
A friend of mine just lit up a joint after school.

00:23:10.900 --> 00:23:12.900
She told me it was the grooviest thing she ever did.

00:23:12.900 --> 00:23:14.900
