00:24:30.900 --> 00:24:32.900
You're a pretty girl.

00:24:32.900 --> 00:24:33.900
You're bright.

00:24:33.900 --> 00:24:36.900
You come from a good family.

00:24:36.900 --> 00:24:40.900
