00:24:40.900 --> 00:24:42.900
Which star gangster do you want?

00:24:42.900 --> 00:24:45.900
Number seven, number nine, or number 11?

00:24:45.900 --> 00:24:49.900
Kim, I want the truth.

00:24:49.900 --> 00:25:01.900
Because I dig it.

00:25:01.900 --> 00:25:08.900
You know, whenever you spring for steak without a fight, I can't help wondering what's in the wind.

00:25:08.900 --> 00:25:12.900
Just routine.

00:25:12.900 --> 00:25:18.900
Tomorrow I want us to infiltrate that high school.

00:25:18.900 --> 00:25:25.900
See if we can get a line on the drugs those young people are getting and their source of supply.

00:25:25.900 --> 00:25:46.900
Which one of us do you intend to duke in as a teenager?

