From the way the other students acted, it wasn't the first time he's shown up in class that way.

00:26:56.900 --> 00:27:00.900
Well, why wouldn't a teacher report something as obvious as that?

00:27:00.900 --> 00:27:01.900
There's several reasons.

00:27:01.900 --> 00:27:03.900
I'd like to hear them.

00:27:03.900 --> 00:27:08.900
Well, some teachers feel they're here to teach, not apprehend addicts.

00:27:08.900 --> 00:27:13.900
Others don't want to get involved in what could be a very nasty situation.

00:27:13.900 --> 00:27:20.900
And a few, who I am weeding out, don't want to jeopardize their I'm-your-buddy image.

00:27:20.900 --> 00:27:23.900
Mr. Fall, there are 4,200 students in this school.

00:27:23.900 --> 00:27:28.900
I'm sure you realize that at least 30% of them are turning on.

00:27:28.900 --> 00:27:30.900
It's over 1,200.

