00:30:19.900 --> 00:30:20.900
Find out who her friends are.

00:30:20.900 --> 00:30:21.900
We'll check the high school.

00:30:21.900 --> 00:30:23.900
Right.

00:30:23.900 --> 00:30:25.900
Mark!

00:30:25.900 --> 00:30:43.900
♪

00:30:55.900 --> 00:31:06.900
♪

00:31:26.900 --> 00:31:30.900
No, I, uh, I wouldn't have any way of knowing where she could have gone.

00:31:30.900 --> 00:31:31.900
Just a chance.

00:31:31.900 --> 00:31:32.900
What about your shakedown?

00:31:32.900 --> 00:31:33.900
How'd you make out?

00:31:33.900 --> 00:31:36.900
Not as well as we had expected from you.

00:31:36.900 --> 00:31:38.900
I only got drugs out of nine lockers.

00:31:38.900 --> 00:31:39.900
Kim's?

00:31:39.900 --> 00:31:42.900
Including hers.

00:31:42.900 --> 00:31:49.900
