00:31:49.900 --> 00:31:52.900
The little black one's opium.

00:31:52.900 --> 00:31:54.900
I saw some pictures of it in the magazine.

00:31:54.900 --> 00:31:55.900
How'd you know?

00:31:55.900 --> 00:31:59.900
Mr. Fall.

00:31:59.900 --> 00:32:01.900
Just a moment.

00:32:01.900 --> 00:32:02.900
It's for you.

00:32:02.900 --> 00:32:04.900
Officer Whitfield.

00:32:04.900 --> 00:32:07.900
Yes, Eve.

00:32:07.900 --> 00:32:08.900
Well, good.

00:32:08.900 --> 00:32:10.900
Let me have them.

00:32:10.900 --> 00:32:12.900
Thank you.

00:32:12.900 --> 00:32:14.900
Yeah.

00:32:14.900 --> 00:32:17.900
Okay.

00:32:17.900 --> 00:32:20.900
C-H-A-Y.

00:32:20.900 --> 00:32:21.900
That's it.

00:32:21.900 --> 00:32:23.900
Four.

00:32:23.900 --> 00:32:28.900
All right, I will.

00:32:28.900 --> 00:32:33.900
May I have an office to question these four girls?

00:32:33.900 --> 00:32:34.900
Of course.

00:32:34.900 --> 00:32:38.900
