00:32:42.900 --> 00:32:43.900
Why?

00:32:43.900 --> 00:32:44.900
Except for Kim, who wasn't here.

00:32:44.900 --> 00:32:49.900
The only reason I can figure for the other eight being busters, they couldn't read the signs.

00:32:49.900 --> 00:32:52.900
I wonder why the teachers didn't take the signs off the walls.

00:32:52.900 --> 00:32:53.900
Communications gap.

00:32:53.900 --> 00:32:57.900
They didn't understand what they meant.

00:32:57.900 --> 00:33:05.900
I can't believe all teachers are that naive.

00:33:05.900 --> 00:33:10.900
Not one of these four girls is at school today.

00:33:10.900 --> 00:33:15.900
The reason none of the girls showed up in school is that one of the girls, Susan Burgess, wasn't feeling well.

00:33:15.900 --> 00:33:18.900
The others ditched class to keep her company.

00:33:18.900 --> 00:33:20.900
Sure a lot different than in my day.

00:33:20.900 --> 00:33:21.900
Where are you now?

00:33:21.900 --> 00:33:22.900
Back at the Channing house with Eve.

00:33:22.900 --> 00:33:24.900
We thought we could pick up some other leads.

00:33:24.900 --> 00:33:26.900
Eve better stay with her sister.

00:33:26.900 --> 00:33:27.900
You get an A.P.B. rolling.

