Ashbury, North Beach, everywhere a teenager might show up.

00:33:30.900 --> 00:33:32.900
What about Susan Burgess and the other girls?

00:33:32.900 --> 00:33:49.900
My department.

00:33:49.900 --> 00:33:50.900
You're fuzzed.

